OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APoland shooting as three more bodies
OL,5,Afound at gunman's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FA British citizen is among six people
OL,8,Fkilled in the Krakow shooting, the head
OL,9,Fof Poland's police force says
OL,11,FMarek BoroED says three Polish citizens
OL,12,Fwere also killed, with two yet to be
OL,13,Fidentified - 16 people were injured in
OL,14,Fthe attack, including the suspect, two
OL,15,Fpolice officers and five foreign
OL,16,Fnationals
OL,18,FSpeaking at the same press conference,
OL,19,FPolish Prime Minister Donald Tusk says
OL,20,Fthree more bodies were found at the
OL,21,Fsuspect's home, which authorities
OL,22,Fcontinue to search
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
