OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APoland shooting as three more bodies
OL,5,Afound at gunman's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FPoland's interior minister said earlier
OL,8,Fthe suspect - a 25-year-old Polish
OL,9,Fcitizen - is believed to have been
OL,10,Finspired by "far-right ideologies",
OL,11,Fwhile police said he used "military
OL,12,Fweapons" in the attack
OL,14,FA 24-year-old university student told
OL,15,Four reporter that he pulled his
OL,16,Fgirlfriend and her "petrified" parents
OL,17,Finto a hotel to hide during the attack
OL,19,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in
OL,20,FKrakow's Main Market Square; images
OL,21,Fshow emergency services at the scene
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
